WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.712
My happiest day
hasn't happened yet.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.798
But it's about to.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.636
On that day,

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:15.933
I'm going to get in my car
that smells like old tuna,

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.686
which will be packed
with all of my belongings

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.897
and my amazing daughter,

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:25.317
and I'm gonna drive
the fuck out of this town.

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:29.029
I'm going to drive
nine hours,

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.574
566 miles,

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:35.327
to Missoula, Montana,

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:40.082
where I'm going to spend
the next four years

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.626
learning to be a writer.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:46.922
Hopefully there will be
a lot of happy days

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.131
during that time.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.177
And I know there will be
some hard ones.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.348
Most people
would bet against

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:59.393
the single mum putting
herself through college,

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.814
but they don't know
what it took to get here.

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:09.820
338 toilets cleaned,

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:14.908
seven types of
government assistance,

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:18.495
nine separate moves,

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:22.708
one night on
the ferry station floor,

00:01:24.209 --> 00:01:28.422
and the entire third year
of my daughter's life.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.718
But, when we get
to Missoula,

00:01:34.136 --> 00:01:36.263
I'm going to take Maddy
up Sentinel Mountain,

00:01:37.598 --> 00:01:40.934
which looks over the town,
and show her our new home.

00:01:45.022 --> 00:01:47.524
I've been telling her
all about the giant M

00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:49.318
that's at the tippy-top
of the mountain.

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:59.328
That the trail up there
is long and zigzaggy.

00:02:02.748 --> 00:02:04.249
The hike will be hard.

00:02:06.502 --> 00:02:08.629
But we're gonna
make it to the top.

00:02:11.215 --> 00:02:12.216
And when we do,

00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:17.346
I'm gonna tell her
that the M stands for Maddy.

00:02:20.516 --> 00:02:23.227
That this whole new world
is for her.

